        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4 text-primary">The Grok AI Architecture Behind Grokipedia</h2>

        <p class="mb-6">
          Grokipedia represents one of the most ambitious applications of large language models to date, attempting to automate the entire process of encyclopedia creation. Understanding the technical architecture behind this system reveals both the innovation and the inherent limitations of AI-generated knowledge.
        </p>

        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-3 mt-8">Core Technology Stack</h3>
        <div class="bg-blue-50 dark:bg-blue-950/20 p-6 rounded-lg my-6">
          <h4 class="font-semibold mb-3 text-blue-800 dark:text-blue-200">Technical Components:</h4>
