              <p class="text-sm">AI trained on web content inherits existing biases and perspectives</p>
            </div>
            <div class="border-l-4 border-purple-300 pl-4">
              <h5 class="font-medium mb-1>Lack of Diverse Perspectives:</h5>
              <p class="text-sm">Insufficient representation of global viewpoints in training corpus</p>
            </div>
            <div class="border-l-4 border-purple-300 pl-4">
              <h5 class="font-medium mb-1">Confirmation Bias Reinforcement:</h5>
              <p class="text-sm">System tends to generate content that confirms existing narratives</p>
