        <p class="mb-4">
          Technical analysis reveals significant challenges in scaling Grokipedia's AI approach:
        </p>

        <div class="bg-yellow-50 dark:bg-yellow-950/20 p-6 rounded-lg my-6">
          <h4 class="font-semibold mb-3 text-yellow-800 dark:text-yellow-200">Scalability Concerns:</h4>
          <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2">
            <li><strong>Computational Costs:</strong> Massive processing power required for content generation</li>
            <li><strong>Quality Control Bottlenecks:</strong> Human review becomes impossible at scale</li>
            <li><strong>Consistency Maintenance:</strong> Difficult to maintain quality across millions of articles</li>
            <li><strong>Update Synchronization:</strong> Challenges in keeping content current</li>
