        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4 mt-8">Conclusion: The Fundamental Limitation of AI-Generated Knowledge</h2>

        <div class="bg-primary/10 p-6 rounded-lg my-6">
          <h3 class="font-semibold mb-3">Technical Assessment Summary:</h3>
          <p class="mb-4">
            The technical analysis of Grokipedia's AI system reveals a fundamental truth: current large language models, despite their impressive capabilities, are not yet suitable for autonomous encyclopedic content creation. The challenges of hallucination, source verification, bias amplification, and contextual understanding require significant human oversight that current AI systems cannot replace.
          </p>

          <p class="mb-4">
            While Grokipedia represents an ambitious experiment in AI-generated knowledge, the technical limitations exposed through this analysis suggest that the future of encyclopedic content will likely involve hybrid approaches combining AI assistance with human editorial oversight, rather than complete automation.
          </p>
